WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:15.720
There was a time in my athletic career when my body and my mind hit rock bottom.

00:15.720 --> 00:19.000
I had battled a severe eating disorder.

00:19.000 --> 00:24.760
I had pushed through multiple burnouts and suffered severe sports injuries.

00:24.760 --> 00:31.920
On the outside, it looked like I was winning titles, magazine covers, accolades, traveling

00:31.920 --> 00:37.480
the world with Arnold, but on the inside, I was crumbling.

00:37.480 --> 00:43.400
I was performing at an elite level without a foundation that could actually sustain me.

00:43.400 --> 00:44.400
You know what?

00:44.400 --> 00:49.560
I didn't even realize how dangerous that was until my body forced me to stop.

00:49.560 --> 00:52.160
That was my wake-up call.

00:52.160 --> 00:57.880
I learned that resilience and wellbeing, these aren't just side projects.

00:57.880 --> 01:02.960
These are the main gain because when you lose your health, nothing else matters.

01:02.960 --> 01:08.480
The medals, the money, the milestones, the accolades.

01:08.480 --> 01:12.880
For you as leaders, the pressures may look different than mine as a professional athlete

01:12.880 --> 01:15.480
on a competition stage, but they're really not.

01:15.480 --> 01:17.440
The demands are the same.

01:17.440 --> 01:25.560
Long hours, performance under pressure, high stakes, and the temptation is always there

01:25.560 --> 01:29.680
to sacrifice our own wellbeing for results.

01:29.680 --> 01:35.520
The reality is, is peak performance without sustainable wellness, it's always going to

01:35.520 --> 01:38.120
lead to a breaking point.

01:38.120 --> 01:40.000
When that happens, it doesn't just affect you.

01:40.000 --> 01:44.360
It affects your business, it affects your family, and it affects your legacy.

01:45.320 --> 01:51.120
So Wellness IQ, it's about conditioning yourself from the inside out.

01:51.120 --> 01:55.640
It's about creating a platform for sustainable wellness so that you can thrive in life and

01:55.640 --> 02:03.360
you can lead with energy, with clarity, and with peace amongst pressure.

02:03.360 --> 02:08.520
So if you want to grow as a leader, you have to start by strengthening your foundation

02:08.520 --> 02:12.040
that supports it all, your health and your wellbeing.

02:12.080 --> 02:17.040
And an important question I'd love for you to ask yourself is, if I continue at the same

02:17.040 --> 02:23.760
pace I'm moving at now for the next 10 years, is that possible?

02:23.760 --> 02:26.680
Will I still be thriving in 10 years?

02:26.680 --> 02:32.920
And if that answer isn't a confident yes, it's time to do things differently, right?

02:32.920 --> 02:39.160
You get to lead differently, and that starts with you.

02:39.160 --> 02:47.400
Because when you show up as your healthiest, most resilient, aligned self, that's where

02:47.400 --> 02:52.800
you don't only perform better, that's where the real change starts to happen.

02:52.800 --> 02:58.040
I'm Raelle Graber, and I am so honored and excited to be here with you as a founding

02:58.040 --> 03:01.320
Athletor Pro inside of Athletorship and MVP Accelerator.

03:01.320 --> 03:05.880
I can't wait to help you create sustainable wellness and unlock your next level.

03:05.880 --> 03:06.600
I'll see you inside.

